optix (0.1.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix OSC 52 clipboard support for TUIs (alacritty-style handling,
    CopyPaste mode so apps like opencode can query the clipboard).
  * Add optional alacritty-style wheel scrolling ([scroll] mode = "alacritty")
    alongside the browser-like momentum glide.

